Built with craft: https://github.com/randerson112/craft, one unit

./build/skadis --help
Usage: skadis [sync] [--dry-run]

Syncs each configured Notion <-> Reminders pair using the
`source_of_truth` from ~/.config/skadis/config.json. With
--dry-run, prints the plan without mutating either side.


### Example config:

{
  "ntn_path": "/usr/local/bin/ntn",
  "reminders_path": "/opt/homebrew/bin/reminders",
  "source_of_truth": "Notion",
  "lists": [{ "notion_id": "XXXXXXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXXXXXXXXXX", "reminders_list_name": "main" }]
}

